flowchart TB
  STUDENT[Student] --> UI[Vue Web UI]
  UI --> S2[System 2: Python Planning Agent]
  HS[Harness State: AGENTS.md / Skills / Tool Policy / Context Policy] --> S2
  S2 --> TOOL[Typed Java Tool API v1]
  TOOL --> S1[System 1: Spring Boot Course Environment / Truth / Verifier]
  XLS[2024级培养计划 xls] --> S1
  BA[未来 Browser Adapter: 只读班次快照] --> S1
  FIX[首版: SYNTHETIC 班次 fixture] --> S1
  S1 --> DB[(课程 / 规则 / 班次快照 / provenance)]
  S1 --> SCORE[客观评分]
  S2 --> BENCH[Evolution Benchmark]
  BENCH --> TRACE[Trace + Score + Token + Latency]
  SCORE --> TRACE
  TRACE --> MINER[跨 Case Failure Miner]
  MINER --> EVOLVER[Evolver: 最小 Harness Patch]
  EVOLVER --> CAND[Candidate vN+1]
  CAND --> HOLD[隔离的 Held-out Evaluation]
  HOLD --> GATE{严格提升且无硬指标退化?}
  GATE -->|是| PROMOTE[Promote / lineage]
  GATE -->|否| ROLLBACK[Rollback / 保留审计]
  PROMOTE --> HS
